Z||000001||Cliff Pennock||01-05-2000||05:51 PM||||The reason I didn't turn on HTML is because it's a huge security risk for my server and because it can seriously screw up threads...<P>But if you can tell me what you would like to do with HTML, I can create some extra UBB tags. If for instance you wanted <FONT COLOR=RED><B>color</B></FONT>, I can easily create extra tags for that.||||reg||1
Z||000002||FieroMike||01-05-2000||06:24 PM||||I was thinking more in the lines of text size, and scrolling.  Using this format:<P>&lt;font size=+2 color=#DD0000&gt;&lt;marquee direction="left"&gt; - -  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">Left !!                           <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> - -&lt;/marquee&gt;&lt;/font&gt;<P>&lt;font size=+2 color=#0000DD&gt;&lt;marquee direction="right"&gt; - -                           <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> Right!!                           <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> - -&lt;/marquee&gt;&lt;/font&gt;<P>That way we can use big letters, make them blink, scroll etc...<P>What risks are you talking about?<P>Thanks<BR>Mike||||reg||1
